{"id":2137,"level":74,"name":"Наскрізна атака (1)","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>In the Chessity method, you learn to exploit various types of targets. Unprotected pieces are obvious, but here weâll focus on another type: two pieces aligned on the same file or diagonal.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>When an opponentâs pieces are aligned, it creates opportunities for a powerful skewer. If the front piece moves, the piece behind it becomes vulnerable. During a skewer, your piece appears to âsee throughâ the front piece to attack the one behind.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Fun fact:</strong><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'> Only rooks, bishops, and queens can perform a skewer attack.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"r2qr1k1/pp3pp1/1b1pbn1p/2p5/2PpP3/1B1P1N1P/PP1QNPP1/R3R1K1 b - c3 0 14","pgn":"{[%csl Rd2,Re1][%evp 0,3,-165,-174,-167,-168]} 14... Ba5 15. Qc2 Bxe1 * ","text":"<p>Чорний чорнопольний слон здається пасивним, але це скоро зміниться. <strong>1...Ba5!</strong> і чорні виграють розмін.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"3q1rk1/p1rnb1pp/4p3/4Pp2/2p5/2NP2QP/PPP3P1/R1B1R1K1 b - - 0 19","pgn":"{[#]} 19... Bh4 {[%csl Gd8,Re1,Rg3,Gh4][%cal Gh4e1]} 20. Qf3 Bxe1 * ","text":"<p>Знову чорні можуть виграти розмін, але цього разу з ходом слона по інший бік дошки.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78448,"fen":"2rr2k1/pp2ppbp/1q4p1/8/3Pp3/P1B1P2P/1P1Q1PP1/2R2RK1 w - - 0 20","pgn":"{[%csl Rb6,Rd8][%evp 0,3,222,231,255,275]} {Q=1} 20. Ba5 Qa6 21. Bxd8 * ","format":27,"texts":["Дві ворожі фігури на одній діагоналі, що дає шанси!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78453,"fen":"r4rk1/pp1bb1pp/4pp2/q2P4/5P2/1Q3N2/PP3PBP/R2R2K1 b - - 0 18","pgn":"{[%csl Rb3,Rd1][%evp 0,3,-20,-29,-55,-60]} {Q=1} 18... B